# URLs that lychee may not check: one regular expression per line.
# Each one is a page that works in a browser but refuses automated clients.
# Check each one by hand when you touch the document that links it.
# The rule and its cases: docs/development.md, section "Docs check".

# Android Authority answers every automated client with 403 Forbidden.
# Linked from docs/adr/0004-minimum-android-10.md. Checked in a browser on 9 November 2026.
^https://www\.androidauthority\.com/
